Phase AV: Multi-game protocol adaptation + cross-game transfer learning foundation.

20 new modules implementing:
- GameProtocolAdapterBase (M666): Abstract adapter interface for all games
- LolProtocolAdapter (M667): LoL Live Client Data + Fiddler adapter
- Dota2ProtocolAdapter (M668): Dota2 GSI protocol adapter
- MahjongProtocolAdapter (M669): Majsoul MITM/mjai protocol adapter
- UniversalGameStateSchema (M670): Cross-game state validation
- CrossGameRewardNormalizer (M671): Unified reward scaling [-1,1]
- CrossGameActionSpaceUnifier (M672): Bidirectional action mapping
- CrossGameTrainingDataFormatter (M673): Unified (state,action,reward) triples
- GameAdapterRegistry (M674): Hot-plug adapter registry
- TransferLearningFeatureAligner (M675): Feature space alignment
- CrossGameModelHub (M676): Model versioning with lineage tracking
- ProtocolAdapterTestHarness (M677): Standardized conformance testing
- CrossGamePerformanceComparator (M678): Cross-game metrics comparison
- GameSpecificDecoderFactory (M679): Cached decoder factory
- CrossGameCoachingTemplateEngine (M680): Universal coaching templates
- CrossGameTelemetryAggregator (M681): Unified telemetry collection
- GameKnowledgeTransferEngine (M682): Strategy knowledge transfer
- MultiGameSessionManager (M683): Concurrent session management
- CrossGameEvolutionTracker (M684): Multi-game evolution + transfer effects
- MultiGamePipelineOrchestrator (M685): Top-level multi-game orchestrator

All modules follow established patterns:
- evolution_callback for self-evolution tracking
- O(1) dispatch via dict lookup
- Idempotent lifecycle (connect/disconnect)
- Graceful error handling (never crash caller)

References (拿来主义):
- Akagi/mitm/bridge/majsoul/liqi.py: protobuf decode pattern
- dota2bot-OpenHyperAI/: GSI game state structure
- DI-star: observation normalization pattern
- dual_channel_fuser.py: multi-source fusion interface
- capture_to_decision_orchestrator.py (M665): pipeline orchestration

